ocs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Result and continuity"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","content":"Prepare an evaluation DMS, enroll `est-device-001` from the client and use its identity with a local consumer that requires a certificate. The path connects administrator policy to the material the device actually installs."},"1475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"A Lamassu instance accessible through HTTPS and permissions for CAs, profiles, DMSs and reading devices/certificates."},"1476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"Bash, OpenSSL 3.x, curl with `--fail-with-body` and two terminals on your computer. Work in a new directory with restricted access."},"1477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active root CA that issues directly, with an available key and sufficient validity. Follow Create your first CA. Save its verified public certificate as `device-root.pem`."},"1478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"Available global identifier `est-device-001`. This path uses automatic registration: do not create the device in the console first."},"1479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"The approved root for Lamassu HTTPS in `est-trust.pem`, obtained through an independent channel. It can differ from the device CA; prepare networking/TLS in Deployment."},"1480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"Issue a bootstrap leaf certificate with `CN=est-device-001`, its own key and Client Authentication use. Follow Issue and verify a certificate, changing its CN and saving the result as `bootstrap.crt` and `bootstrap.key`. Choose validity that covers this test and check the pair and chain."},"1481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"The same root CA can issue it for this isolated evaluation. The operational identity will have a different key and certificate. The matching CN makes the example easier to read; initial certificate authentication does not itself bind the bootstrap CN to the requested ID. Review admission before applying the policy to a population."},"1482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create an explicit leaf profile compatible with EC P-256, with **Honor Subject**, CN from the CSR, **Digital Signature**, **Client Authentication** and **1 hour** validity within the root's validity. Do not enable CA signing. Rules and precedence are explained in Profiles."},"1483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create the `Acme EST Evaluation` DMS with this configuration:"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Setting"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Evaluation value"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-21","page_id":"/docs/p