 the DMS and initial trust."},"1624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"The device client requests a certificate and installs it with the matching key."},"1625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"The consumer validates the identity and applies its access permissions."},"1626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"See How Lamassu works to understand the resources and platform architecture for the services. Installation, network exposure and dependencies are explained in Deployment."},"1627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#build-your-trust-hierarchy","content":"Create or incorporate authorities and organize their relationships in PKI. The hierarchy and its rotation determine which chains consumers must recognize."},"1628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#protect-cryptographic-keys","content":"Choose the engine that keeps authority keys and control who can use them. See Keys and engines; provider setup belongs to deployment."},"1629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#issue-and-control-certificates","content":"Define issuance profiles, sign requests and review the certificate inventory. Check the issued certificate from the client that will use it."},"1630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#automate-device-identities","content":"Configure a DMS and use EST to request and renew certificates. Preparing the initial credential and installing the result belong to device integration."},"1631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#publish-validation-status","content":"Use OCSP and CRL to publish revocation status. Each consumer must configure how it retrieves and applies that information."},"1632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#react-to-events","content":"Use audit logs to investigate changes and configure alerts and subscriptions to react to lifecycle events."},"1633":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#operational-reference","content":"Responsibility"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#operational-reference","content":"What it prepares or checks"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview#operational-reference","content":"PKI administrator"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/overview-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/ov