[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#start-here","content":"You can complete that path before managing devices. When you need to associate the identity with an inventory or automate its enrollment, continue in IoT Fleets."},"2243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#what-you-need","content":"An accessible instance and permission to manage the keys, CAs and certificates you will use."},"2244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#what-you-need","content":"An available cryptographic engine to keep the authority's key."},"2245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#what-you-need","content":"The certificate's purpose, such as authenticating a client through mTLS."},"2246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#what-you-need","content":"Consumer requirements: accepted issuers, algorithms, names and permitted usages."},"2247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#what-you-need","content":"Prepare the instance and cryptographic provider in Deployment. The trust model explains hierarchy choices."},"2248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/overview#build-your-