ment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs