-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Este recorrido está dirigido a quien empieza a administrar identidades de dispositivos. Registrarás `device-001` y le asignarás un certificado existente para comprobar la relación entre dispositivo, DMS e historial de identidad."},"1548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"La asignación modifica el inventario de Lamassu. La clave y el certificado se instalan por separado en el dispositivo; la conexión con un consumidor se comprueba en la integración de ese destino."},"1549":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia accesible y permisos para administrar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1550":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1551":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1552":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` libre en el inventario. Si ya lo usaste, elige otro y emite el certificado con ese mismo `Common Name`."},"1553":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Un DMS debe existir antes de registrar el dispositivo. Si ya tienes uno adecuado, comprueba su CA y anota su identificador; si necesitas crearlo:"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1555":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-flee