l servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1564":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1565":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Confirma el registro."},"1566":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo. Debe aparecer en **No Identity** y mostrar el DMS propietario seleccionado."},"1567":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"El registro crea la entrada de inventario; el certificado todavía debe asociarse."},"1568":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity** y el certificado existente con `CN=device-001`. Comprueba 