orm/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Para utilizar la identidad en AWS IoT Core, prepara también la confianza y los permisos del destino. Comprueba la conexión desde el dispositivo después de instalar la clave, el certificado y la cadena necesarios."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"page","content":"Plataforma Lamassu IoT","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","content":"Construye una PKI y aplica sus certificados al ciclo de vida de tus dispositivos."},"1591":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"Empieza aquí"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Elige tu recorrido"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"Arquitectura de un vistazo"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview#capacidades-principales","content":"Capacidades principales"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":